                    <h2 class="sub">                    Omnidirectional Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Bartlett Audio Mandolin Mic is an omnidirectional miniature condenser mic designed to reproduce the natural sound of mandolin-family instruments while allowing the player freedom of motion in a performance setting. The mic is mounted outside the f-hole (or oval-hole) with a felt-covered clip.</p><p>The Mandolin Mic has a permanently attached 8-foot cable terminating in an XLR connector. It can be plugged into an instrument amp or mixer. It requires phantom power.</p><p>For higher volume band situations, Bartlett also makes the Mandolin Mic-LB, which provides greater volume before feedback.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/bartlett/Mandolin-Mic">Bartlett Audio Mandolin-Mic</a></p>
